# Runtime data (bind-mounted DATA_DIR). ANCHORED with a leading slash: the
# unanchored "data/" matched at every depth, which silently untracked
# backend/app/data/ -- the synergy patterns, functional quotas, bracket
# patterns and CSV flavours. Those are the deck engine's rules, not runtime
# state, and they went unversioned (and unbackupable) for the whole project.
/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

